   "item-arrow-poison-grandmaster": "Grandmaster Poison Arrow",
+  "item-arrow-poison-toxicwater": "Toxicwater Poison Arrow",
   "poison-arrow-effect": "Poison: {0} damage/second for {1} seconds ({2} total damage).",
   "itemdesc-arrow-poison-mild": "Poisons a struck target for 0.2 damage per second for 8 seconds, refreshing up to 12 seconds. Hunters call it the warning dose, though prey rarely understands the warning.",
   "itemdesc-arrow-poison-standard": "Poisons a struck target for 0.3 damage per second for 12 seconds, refreshing up to 18 seconds. It became the guild standard after surviving every climate and every impatient apprentice.",
   "itemdesc-arrow-poison-potent": "Poisons a struck target for 0.4 damage per second for 16 seconds, refreshing up to 24 seconds. Old rangers loose one only after deciding a trail must end here.",
-  "itemdesc-arrow-poison-grandmaster": "Poisons a struck target for 0.5 damage per second for 20 seconds, refreshing up to 30 seconds, and requires Hive Alchemist mastery. The final guild trial is not brewing it, but knowing when not to fire."
+  "itemdesc-arrow-poison-grandmaster": "Poisons a struck target for 0.5 damage per second for 20 seconds, refreshing up to 30 seconds, and requires Hive Alchemist mastery. The final guild trial is not brewing it, but knowing when not to fire.",
+  "itemdesc-arrow-poison-toxicwater": "Poisons a struck target for 0.6 damage per second for 24 seconds, adding doses up to 36 seconds. It is stronger than Grandmaster Poison because the mire was never designed to leave survivors.",
+
+  "realm-discovered-one-recipe": "Discovered {0}. One new level recipe and its Survival Handbook guide are now unlocked.",
+  "realm-discovered-many-recipes": "Discovered {0}. {1} new level recipes and its Survival Handbook guide are now unlocked.",
+  "toxicwater-recipe-locked": "You do not understand how to use Toxicwater yet. Discover the Poison Mire first.",
+  "handbook-realm-locked-text": "<strong>Undiscovered realm</strong><br><br>Enter this realm's core to reveal its dangers and level-owned crafting knowledge.",
+
+  "handbook-realm-barren-desert-title": "Barren Desert",
+  "handbook-realm-barren-desert-text": "<strong>Level 1</strong><br><br>A land-only desert of punishing heat, sparse water and long exposed crossings.<br><br><strong>New crafting knowledge</strong><br>No level-owned crafting recipes are assigned yet.",
+  "handbook-realm-deep-sea-title": "Deep Sea",
+  "handbook-realm-deep-sea-text": "<strong>Level 2</strong><br><br>A continuous salt-water crossing. Prepare flotation, food and a route before leaving shore.<br><br><strong>New crafting knowledge</strong><br>No level-owned crafting recipes are assigned yet.",
+  "handbook-realm-endless-forest-title": "Endless Forest",
+  "handbook-realm-endless-forest-text": "<strong>Level 3</strong><br><br>Dense forest and violent relief hide threats at close range. The world map cannot guide you here.<br><br><strong>New crafting knowledge</strong><br>No level-owned crafting recipes are assigned yet.",
+  "handbook-realm-shadow-forest-title": "Shadow Forest",
+  "handbook-realm-shadow-forest-text": "<strong>Level 4</strong><br><br>An older, darker forest broken by dead clearings and valleys. Visibility is the first danger.<br><br><strong>New crafting knowledge</strong><br>No level-owned crafting recipes are assigned yet.",
+  "handbook-realm-frozen-expanse-title": "Frozen Expanse",
+  "handbook-realm-frozen-expanse-text": "<strong>Level 5</strong><br><br>Glacier ridges, exposed ice and spike fields leave little shelter across the open ring.<br><br><strong>New crafting knowledge</strong><br>No level-owned crafting recipes are assigned yet.",
+  "handbook-realm-poison-mire-title": "Poison Mire",
+  "handbook-realm-poison-mire-text": "<strong>Level 6</strong><br><br>A dead wetland of ash, peat, sulphur stains and leafless growth. Every pool in the realm core is Toxicwater.<br><br><strong>Toxicwater exposure</strong><br>Touching or swimming in Toxicwater applies 0.6 poison damage per second for 24 seconds. Continued contact or another dose can extend the effect up to 36 seconds. This is stronger than Grandmaster Poison.<br><br><strong>New crafting knowledge</strong><br><strong>Toxicwater Poison Arrows — item interaction</strong><br>Hold a stack of at least 8 ordinary Vintage Story arrows and right-click Toxicwater. Eight arrows become Toxicwater Poison Arrows. The poisoned water itself is not consumed.<br><br>Each struck target receives the same Toxicwater poison effect as direct contact with the mire.",
+  "handbook-realm-shattered-highlands-title": "Shattered Highlands",
+  "handbook-realm-shattered-highlands-text": "<strong>Level 7</strong><br><br>Broken high ground demands careful climbing and a safe retreat route.<br><br><strong>New crafting knowledge</strong><br>No level-owned crafting recipes are assigned yet.",
+  "handbook-realm-crystal-labyrinth-title": "Crystal Labyrinth",
+  "handbook-realm-crystal-labyrinth-text": "<strong>Level 8</strong><br><br>A disorienting realm where reflected paths make distance and direction unreliable.<br><br><strong>New crafting knowledge</strong><br>No level-owned crafting recipes are assigned yet.",
+  "handbook-realm-ashen-march-title": "Ashen March",
+  "handbook-realm-ashen-march-text": "<strong>Level 9</strong><br><br>A scorched march where shelter, supplies and visibility fail together.<br><br><strong>New crafting knowledge</strong><br>No level-owned crafting recipes are assigned yet.",
+  "handbook-realm-hell-title": "Hell",
+  "handbook-realm-hell-text": "<strong>Level 10</strong><br><br>The outermost realm. Enter only with a plan for survival and return.<br><br><strong>New crafting knowledge</strong><br>No level-owned crafting recipes are assigned yet."
 }
